The `Job` model contains:

```text
id
airtable_id
job_id
title
company
location
remote
description
url
field
company_industry
min_experience
requirements
required_skills
language_requirement
education_requirements
posted
```

Additional Airtable fields such as:

```text
salary
point_of_contact
linkedin
email
phone
```

may remain part of the ingestion/source data where applicable, but should only be added to the DB model/API when actually required by the application.

## ID Rules

```text
id
↓
internal PostgreSQL identity

airtable_id
↓
unique Airtable record identity

job_id
↓
external/business job identifier
```

