# 15. API RESPONSE ARCHITECTURE

All API responses use:

```text
BaseResponse[T]
```

Structure:

```text
success
status_code
message
data
```

Example:

```python
return BaseResponse(
    success=True,
    status_code=StatusCode.OK,
    message=SuccessMessage.SUCCESS,
    data=None,
)
```

Pydantic models must use keyword arguments.

