# 18. CENTRALIZED LOGGING

Central logger:

```text
app/core/logger.py
```

Usage:

```python
from app.core.logger import logger
```

Services that perform meaningful operations should use the centralized logger.

Do not create separate logger instances unnecessarily.

Do not log sensitive data.

Important production events include:

```text
CV upload started
CV analysis started
CV analysis completed
Gemini request started
Gemini request completed
Gemini quota exceeded

Job fetch started
Job fetch completed

Cache HIT
Cache MISS

Matching started
Matching completed

Job ingestion started
Job ingestion completed

Job sync started
Job sync completed
```

Low-level pure functions such as normalization, filtering rules, and score calculation should not produce per-item production logs.

